    "Il daemon Docker non è raggiungibile. Avvialo e riprova." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the error message displayed when the",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Image \"%@\" (ID %@), not used by any container. Removing it frees space INSIDE Docker's VM, but it isn't returned to macOS until you compact Docker's disk (Docker.raw doesn't shrink on its own). Regenerable: if you still need it, a new pull or build recreates it." : {
      "comment" : "A warning explaining that an image is dangling (not used by any container) and that removing it frees space in Docker's VM.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Image \"%1$@\" (ID %2$@), not used by any container. Removing it frees space INSIDE Docker's VM, but it isn't returned to macOS until you compact Docker's disk (Docker.raw doesn't shrink on its own). Regenerable: if you still need it, a new pull or build recreates it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Image \"%1$@\" (ID %2$@), not used by any container. Removing it frees space INSIDE Docker's VM, but it isn't returned to macOS until you compact Docker's disk (Docker.raw doesn't shrink on its own). Regenerable: if you still need it, a new pull or build recreates it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الصورة \"%1$@\" (المعرّف %2$@)، غير مستخدمة من أي حاوية. إزالتها تحرّر مساحة داخل الجهاز الافتراضي لـ Docker، لكنها لا تُعاد إلى macOS حتى تضغط قرص Docker (لا يتقلّص Docker.raw من تلقاء نفسه). قابلة لإعادة الإنشاء: إن احتجتها مجددًا، يعيد سحب أو بناء جديد إنشاءها."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imagen \"%1$@\" (ID %2$@), no usada por ningún contenedor. Eliminarla libera espacio DENTRO de la VM de Docker, pero no se devuelve a macOS hasta que compactes el disco de Docker (Docker.raw no se reduce solo). Regenerable: si aún la necesitas, un nuevo pull o build la recrea."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Image « %1$@ » (ID %2$@), utilisée par aucun conteneur. La supprimer libère de l'espace DANS la VM de Docker, mais il n'est pas rendu à macOS tant que vous ne compactez pas le disque de Docker (Docker.raw ne se réduit pas tout seul). Régénérable : si vous en avez encore besoin, un nouveau pull ou build la recrée."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Immagine \"%1$@\" (ID %2$@), non usata da alcun container. Rimuoverla libera spazio DENTRO la VM di Docker, ma non viene restituito a macOS finché non compatti il disco di Docker (Docker.raw non si rimpicciolisce da solo). Rigenerabile: se ti serve ancora, un nuovo pull o build la ricrea."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镜像“%1$@”（ID %2$@），未被任何容器使用。移除它会释放 Docker 虚拟机内部的空间，但在你压缩 Docker 磁盘之前不会归还给 macOS（Docker.raw 不会自动缩小）。可重新生成：如果仍需要，重新拉取或构建即可重建。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It goes to the Trash and is recoverable. Frees %@." : {
