    "No installed app matches the bundle \"%@\". This folder holds the data the app left behind (documents, preferences, state) — last modified: %@. If the app was only temporarily removed, reinstalling it would pick these data back up; otherwise they are leftover remains." : {
      "comment" : "A warning that an app is missing but its data is still on disk.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "No installed app matches the bundle \"%1$@\". This folder holds the data the app left behind (documents, preferences, state) — last modified: %2$@. If the app was only temporarily removed, reinstalling it would pick these data back up; otherwise they are leftover remains."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No installed app matches the bundle \"%1$@\". This folder holds the data the app left behind (documents, preferences, state) — last modified: %2$@. If the app was only temporarily removed, reinstalling it would pick these data back up; otherwise they are leftover remains." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يوجد تطبيق مثبَّت يطابق الحزمة \"%1$@\". يحتوي هذا المجلد على البيانات التي تركها التطبيق (مستندات، تفضيلات، حالة) — آخر تعديل: %2$@. إذا كان التطبيق قد أُزيل مؤقتًا فقط، فإعادة تثبيته ستستعيد هذه البيانات؛ وإلا فهي بقايا مفقودة."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ninguna app instalada coincide con el paquete \"%1$@\". Esta carpeta contiene los datos que dejó la app (documentos, preferencias, estado): última modificación: %2$@. Si la app solo se quitó temporalmente, reinstalarla recuperaría estos datos; de lo contrario, son restos perdidos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aucune app installée ne correspond au bundle « %1$@ ». Ce dossier contient les données laissées par l'app (documents, préférences, état) — dernière modification : %2$@. Si l'app n'a été retirée que temporairement, la réinstaller récupérerait ces données ; sinon, ce sont des restes perdus."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nessuna app installata corrisponde al bundle \"%1$@\". Questa cartella contiene i dati che l'app lasciò (documenti, preferenze, stato) — ultima modifica: %2$@. Se l'app era solo temporaneamente rimossa, reinstallandola questi dati verrebbero ripresi; altrimenti sono residui persi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有已安装的应用与包“%1$@”匹配。此文件夹保存该应用遗留的数据（文档、偏好设置、状态）——最后修改：%2$@。如果该应用只是被临时移除，重新安装即可恢复这些数据；否则它们只是残留物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
